WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.530 --> 00:00:03.080
 Being an artist,
wanting to make something,

00:00:03.080 --> 00:00:05.390
how do we start
with a blank canvas?

00:00:05.390 --> 00:00:06.800
I like to start with an idea.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:08.576
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:13.020
Ideas come from sensations.

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:16.110
You don't have ideas
without having sensations.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:22.230
The art is never in the
painting that you're looking at,

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.070
or the surface of the sculpture.

00:00:24.070 --> 00:00:25.980
The art is inside you.

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:30.600
When the lights at the museum go
off, nothing's happening there.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:32.730
But within you,
everything exists.

00:00:35.720 --> 00:00:38.390
We're going to be speaking
about the ready-made, which

00:00:38.390 --> 00:00:42.230
is pulling an object from
its everyday situation

00:00:42.230 --> 00:00:45.950
and bringing it into a
context where it could

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:49.130
take on different meaning.

00:00:49.130 --> 00:00:52.430
I want to show you the major
building blocks of art.

00:00:52.430 --> 00:00:53.150
Color.

00:00:53.150 --> 00:00:54.710
Colors carry meaning.

00:00:54.710 --> 00:00:55.670
Texture.

00:00:55.670 --> 00:00:57.860
I feel my fingers
want to stretch out.

00:00:57.860 --> 00:00:59.060
I get goose bumps.

00:00:59.060 --> 00:01:00.350
I want more.

00:01:00.350 --> 00:01:01.280
Scale.

00:01:01.280 --> 00:01:03.170
How big do you
want to make that?

00:01:03.170 --> 00:01:04.040
And form.

00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:05.930
As we go into the
three-dimensional,

00:01:05.930 --> 00:01:07.430
we're dealing with form.

00:01:07.430 --> 00:01:09.380
But there are no rules.

00:01:09.380 --> 00:01:12.350
Everything in your life
is source material,

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:15.500
and the more you open yourself,
the more meaning you'll

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:17.360
find in every action you take.

00:01:20.710 --> 00:01:22.870
There is nothing
special about me.

00:01:22.870 --> 00:01:25.210
There's nothing special
about my experiences,

00:01:25.210 --> 00:01:26.950
other than they
were my experiences,

00:01:26.950 --> 00:01:29.800
and I've embraced them.

00:01:29.800 --> 00:01:33.860
Your experiences, your
memories, everything about you,

00:01:33.860 --> 00:01:34.555
it's perfect.

00:01:37.440 --> 00:01:41.190
The only thing that is necessary
is that you have the confidence

00:01:41.190 --> 00:01:43.620
in yourself to follow
your interests,

00:01:43.620 --> 00:01:47.070
and to share those
interests with other people.

00:01:47.070 --> 00:01:50.220
Everybody that's interested
in being an artist,

00:01:50.220 --> 00:01:53.040
the world needs you.

00:01:53.040 --> 00:01:57.110
I'm Jeff Koons, and
this is my MasterClass.

